Package: pkg-cli
Version: 0.2.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: axjab <axjab@github.com>
Description: Create, manage, build, and publish Debian packages
 Manage package metadata, dependencies, executables, configuration files,
 services, and other assets from the terminal. Build Debian archives and
 publish them to signed APT repositories over SSH.
Depends: gum (>= 2.0.2)
